    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this charming two-bedroom, two-bathroom first floor apartment ideally situated in the highly sought after Kiltipper Gate development. Kiltipper Gate is situated right at the foot of the Dublin mountains. The location is next to none as you are within minutes of The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, schools and leisure facilities. Transport links abound with the LUAS, N81 and M50 motorway all within minutes. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious interior living accommodation of c. 58 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with storage room & hot press, large open plan living/dining area with fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. A door from the living area leads onto a private balcony of the lowest maintenance and with a sunny south west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. The front provides ample parking here too. \r\n\r\nNumber 93 Kiltipper Gate comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners and has the potential to be a stunning apartment, the long list of additional features includes built in storage, two double bedrooms, fitted kitchen and gas fired central heating. This property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers including first time buyers looking to take their first steps onto the property ladder but additionally will attract downsizers looking for that bit of comfort in this highly sought-after development. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- C. 58 sqm \r\n- BER B\r\n- Management fees c. 1,320 per annum \r\n- 2 bed / 2 bath \r\n- Situated on the first floor \r\n- Great condition throughout \r\n- Tastefully decorated \r\n- Private balcony \r\n- Sunny south facing orientation \r\n- Perfect for relaxing on them long sunny evenings \r\n- Ample parking\r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Ample storage \r\n- Two double bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Large open plan living/dining area \r\n- Very spacious apartment \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- No onward chain\r\n- Perfect for first time buyers \r\n- Great investment opportunity \r\n- Lovely home for downsizers \r\n- M50 motorway found merely minutes by car \r\n- The Luas easily accessible \r\n\r\nDirections If travelling from The Square Shopping Centre towards Kiltipper - Follow Kiltipper Way and proceed straight through the roundabout of Marlfield Mall/Arcadia Bar & Restaurant. Take the third exit from the next roundabout and turn right. Proceed ahead and veer right into Kiltipper Gate where number 93 will be clearly sign posted on the right."
      },
